    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Jazz Chisholm Jr. is exactly the type of move the #BlueJays should be making. This lineup needs power upside and better base running. This really opens up some potential for the lineup. John Schneider will manage Chisholm well, too. Betting that will be a good relationship.",
      "likes": 92,
      "reposts": 12,
      "replies": 8,
      "at": "2026-11-27T21:09:26.381Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3d3wu3jic22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Jazz always seemed like a guy that would benefit from a team centric approach. The Yankees always feel like they're individuals that just happen to play together.\n\nAnd, I love Ernie, but I think he's playing too much, so moving him back to a super-utility role should help him too.",
          "likes": 13,
          "author": "derek.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Absolutely HUGE acquisition 👏👏👏 #Bluejays",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "alexandros2112.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Idk, Yankees fans weren't so keen on his inconsistent play.",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "monkeypeter.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Right now he'd probably be in the.... 2 spot.. in the lineup? 🤔",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "dudgee.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ジャズ・チザム・ジュニアの獲得は#BlueJaysがまさに打つべき手。打線にはパワーの上積みと走塁力の向上が必要だった。ジョン・シュナイダー監督なら上手く起用するはず。いい関係になると見ている。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Facing an oncoming rush of blue, Harrison Butker went too far right.",
      "likes": 97,
      "reposts": 11,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-27T04:00:52.245Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3bchmvqfs2a",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "SAM",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "jenramose.online"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "青い波が押し寄せる中、ハリソン・バトカーは右へ行きすぎた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "I understand the Jazz Chisholm Jr. signing will be divisive among some #BlueJays fans who watched him with the Yankees. This team grew stale by mid-2026, though. It needs some swagger. The 2015-16 Jays weren't all best friends. I think Jazz could be a fan favourite, and quickly.",
      "likes": 93,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 13,
      "at": "2026-11-27T22:11:50.357Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3d7ggmmzk2w",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Just need to bet on whose pants he steals first",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "josephackelly.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "IT NEEDS SOME SWAGGER. That cup was full to the brim in 2025. Last season, it all evaporated. A guy like Jazz should be an instant shot of adrenaline at spring training.",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "swingingbunt.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "i do think Jazz as the everyday 2B will be good to get Clement back as a utility player because he seemed like he was struggling at times last season at second.",
          "likes": 5,
          "author": "marcquill.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "He will be. I can remember so many games last season when he’d steal 2nd and 3rd against us on pretty much consecutive pitches and it drove me nuts. Now he can do that for us…plus hit us 30 bombs.",
          "likes": 5,
          "author": "alexandros2112.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ヤンキース時代を知る#BlueJaysファンの一部には、ジャズ・チザム・ジュニアの獲得に賛否があるのは承知。ただ、チームは2026年半ばには停滞していた。必要なのは swagger だ。2015〜16年のジェイズも全員が仲良しだったわけじゃない。ジャズは早くファンの人気者になれると思う。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "With Cubs adding Japanese right-hander Hiromi Itoh, who reached a deal with the team source confirms to the Tribune, they get a pitcher that has consistently given innings (172+ IP the last three seasons), something Cubs really need from the 29 year old.",
